    <div class="age-label">
      <span class="age-label-txt">
        How skin ages
      </span>
    </div>
  


  <div class="age-copy">

    
      <h2 class="age-h">
        Skin doesn't fail.<br>
The routine <em>does.</em>
      </h2>
    


    <div class="age-grid">

      
        <div class="age-item">

          
            <div class="age-item-n">
              01
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-h">
              Cell renewal slows
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-p">
              <p>At 25, skin renews itself every 28 days. By 40, that cycle has stretched to 45-60 days. The same biology is there. It just needs fewer interruptions and more support to keep pace.</p>
            </div>
          

        </div>
      
        <div class="age-item">

          
            <div class="age-item-n">
              02
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-h">
              Collagen production drops
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-p">
              <p>After 25, collagen production falls by roughly 1% per year. The structural protein that keeps skin firm isn't disappearing. Your body is producing less of it. That's a signal problem, not a structural one.</p>
            </div>
          

        </div>
      
        <div class="age-item">

          
            <div class="age-item-n">
              03
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-h">
              The barrier weakens
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-p">
              <p>Your skin barrier is a lipid matrix: ceramides, fatty acids, cholesterol in specific ratios. When that matrix is disrupted by over-actives, the skin loses water faster than it produces it. Most actives make this worse.</p>
            </div>
          

        </div>
      
        <div class="age-item">

          
            <div class="age-item-n">
              04
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-h">
              Chronic inflammation builds
            </div>
          

          
            <div class="age-item-p">
              <p>Low-grade, invisible inflammation is the root of almost every visible skin concern: spots, uneven tone, sensitivity, premature ageing. The industry addresses the symptoms. Longevity science addresses the source.</p>
            </div>
          

        </div>
      

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


